Package: permk
Title: Permutation Tests for k Independent Samples
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Tomás", "Jiménez Sánchez", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tomas4122001@gmail.com")
Description: Distribution-free permutation tests for comparing k independent groups.
    A global test with F, Kruskal-Wallis or custom statistics, and pairwise
    two-sample tests with multiplicity correction. P-values use the (b + 1) / (m + 1)
    estimator of Phipson and Smyth (2010) <doi:10.2202/1544-6115.1585>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: graphics, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
